{"id":"5cc25b794abadf8c","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-characteristic-sequence.md","title":"合取类型、析取类型与特征序列","display":"df-characteristic-sequence — 合取类型、析取类型与特征序列","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-characteristic-sequence","aliases":["18-df-characteristic-sequence"],"display":"df-characteristic-sequence — 合取类型、析取类型与特征序列","depends_on":["[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Definitions 5.3.2–5.3.3; §5.4","source_pages":"75,77","source_pdf_pages":"85,87","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-characteristic-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-characteristic-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-characteristic-sequence — 合取类型、析取类型与特征序列"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definitions 5.3.2–5.3.3; §5.4"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"75,77"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"85,87"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a> 的伪句域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span>、闭项、标准项值、对偶与闭项代入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(F,G\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span>；量词式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Qx H\">\\(Qx H\\)</span> 属于此域时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H[x:=\\bar n]\">\\(H[x:=\\bar n]\\)</span> 也属于此域。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CS}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{CS}(F)\\)</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,2\">\\(0,2\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 为域的序列函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\rangle\\)</span> 为空函数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span> 为所列算术语言上游的闭项集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Diag}(\\mathbb N)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{s=t\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\ \\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{s\\ne t\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\ \\operatorname{val}(s)\\ne\\operatorname{val}(t)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf C\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\mathrm{Diag}(\\mathbb N)\\cup\\{F\\land G\\mid F,G\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\}\\cup\n\\{\\forall x H\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf D\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{\\sim_{\\mathrm N}F\\mid F\\in\\mathrm{Diag}(\\mathbb N)\\}\\cup\\{F\\lor G\\mid F,G\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\}\\cup\n\\{\\exists x H\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Diag}(\\mathbb N)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{s=t\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\ \\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{s\\ne t\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\ \\operatorname{val}(s)\\ne\\operatorname{val}(t)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf C\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\mathrm{Diag}(\\mathbb N)\\cup\\{F\\land G\\mid F,G\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\}\\cup\n\\{\\forall x H\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf D\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{\\sim_{\\mathrm N}F\\mid F\\in\\mathrm{Diag}(\\mathbb N)\\}\\cup\\{F\\lor G\\mid F,G\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\}\\cup\n\\{\\exists x H\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CS}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle\\qquad(A\\in A_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\cap\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CS}(F\\circ G)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F,G\\rangle\\qquad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CS}(Qx H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle H[x:=\\bar n]\\mid n&lt;\\omega\\rangle\\qquad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CS}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle\\qquad(A\\in A_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\cap\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CS}(F\\circ G)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F,G\\rangle\\qquad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CS}(Qx H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle H[x:=\\bar n]\\mid n&lt;\\omega\\rangle\\qquad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Definition 5.3.2–5.3.3 和 §5.4 的扩展。开放的集成员文字 t∈X、t∉X 不属于任一类型；不能根据一个未知集赋值把它们放入真原子图。真数值原子是空前提的合取类型，假数值原子是没有可选前提的析取类型。采用带域的序列函数保留实例的索引与重复项。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language","status":"resolved","id":"7ddb1b71680edcd2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language","status":"resolved","id":"7ddb1b71680edcd2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]] 的伪句域 $\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}$、闭项、标准项值、对偶与闭项代入。$F,G\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}$；量词式 $Qx H$ 属于此域时 $H[x:=\\bar n]$ 也属于此域。$\\mathrm{CS}(F)$ 为以 $0,2$ 或 $\\omega$ 为域的序列函数；$\\langle\\rangle$ 为空函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}","display":false},{"tex":"F,G\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}","display":false},{"tex":"Qx H","display":false},{"tex":"H[x:=\\bar n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CS}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"0,2","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Diag}(\\mathbb N)\\coloneqq{}&\\{s=t\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\ \\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{s\\ne t\\mid s,t\\in\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\ \\operatorname{val}(s)\\ne\\operatorname{val}(t)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf C\\coloneqq{}&\\mathrm{Diag}(\\mathbb N)\\cup\\{F\\land G\\mid F,G\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\}\\cup\n\\{\\forall x H\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf D\\coloneqq{}&\\{\\sim_{\\mathrm N}F\\mid F\\in\\mathrm{Diag}(\\mathbb N)\\}\\cup\\{F\\lor G\\mid F,G\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\}\\cup\n\\{\\exists x H\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CS}(A)&\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle\\qquad(A\\in A_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\cap\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CS}(F\\circ G)&\\coloneqq\\langle F,G\\rangle\\qquad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CS}(Qx H)&\\coloneqq\\langle H[x:=\\bar n]\\mid n<\\omega\\rangle\\qquad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2264,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-characteristic-sequence]]"},{"id":"8accc2f8cbc49eab","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}$，$\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$。$\\mathsf C,\\mathsf D,\\mathrm{CS},\\sim_{\\mathrm N},\\mathrm{rk}_{\\mathrm N}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm N}$ 分别取 [[18-df-characteristic-sequence]]、[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]、[[18-df-verification-calculus]] 的定义。对每个固定切秩界 $\\rho$，按高度 $\\alpha$ 定义 $D_\\rho^\\alpha$；下标界严格限制切公式秩。"},{"id":"42776dd9b2915027","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}$，$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$；$\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\mathsf C,\\mathsf D,\\mathrm{CS},\\operatorname{val}$ 见 [[18-df-characteristic-sequence]]。$V^\\alpha$ 是按 $\\alpha$ 超限递归定义的有限公式集谓词。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-characteristic-sequence]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-characteristic-sequence]]"}],"outgoing":["7ddb1b71680edcd2"]}